## Anti-Patterns & Constraints

### Prohibited Patterns
- ❌ **Direct Database Access from UI:** All data access must go through APIs
- ❌ **Hardcoded Configuration:** Use environment variables or config files
- ❌ **God Objects:** Keep components focused and single-responsibility
- ❌ **Tight Coupling:** Maintain loose coupling between layers

### Architectural Constraints
- All external dependencies must be abstracted behind interfaces
- Cross-layer communication must use DTOs, not domain entities
- Configuration must be externalized
- Secrets must never be committed to source control

